※ pl4g-test: compile=ok run=native,qemu exit=80 diag=none

※ A distance of the width or more has no answer, and the three architectures
※ answer it three different ways -- two take the distance modulo the width of
※ the *register*, which is not the width of the type.  So it is asked about,
※ and the program stops the same way everywhere.

let thirteen: u6 = 13u6
let eight: u6 = 8u6

@[startup]
fn main() → u6:
    thirteen « eight
